{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04789","headline":"清远江峡山寺 · 张说","name":"清远江峡山寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"流落经荒外，逍遥此梵宫。\n云峰吐月白，石壁淡烟红。\n宝塔灵仙涌，悬龛造化功。\n天香涵竹气，虚呗引松风。\n檐牖飞花入，廊房激水通。\n猿鸣知谷静，鱼戏辨江空。\n静默将何贵，惟应心境同。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04789.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04789","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}